</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thy life in me be shown,</l><l>Lord, I would henceforth seek</l><l>To think and speak</l><l>Thy thoughts, Thy words alone,</l><l>No more my own.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy love, Thy joy, Thy peace,</l><l>Continuously impart</l><l>Unto my heart,</l><l>Fresh springs that never cease,</l><l>But still increase.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The blest reality</l><l>Of resurrection power,</l><l>Thy Church’s dower,</l><l>Life more abundantly,</l><l>Lord, give to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thy fullest gift, O Lord,</l><l>Now at Thy word I claim,</l><l>Through Thy dear Name,</l><l>And touch the rapturous chord</l><l>Of praise forth-poured.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Jesus, my life is Thine,</l><l>And evermore shall be</l><l>Hidden in Thee,</l><l>For nothing can untwine</l><l>Thy life from mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
